<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

```
    .container {
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .header {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #0B5CAB;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .section {
        margin-top: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .details-table {
        border-collapse: collapse;
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .details-table th,
    .details-table td {
        border: 1px solid #dddddd;
        padding: 10px;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .details-table th {
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        width: 220px;
    }

    .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .warning {
        color: #C23934;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
</style>
```

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

```
<div class="header">
    AHIP / FFM Certification Expiry Alert
</div>

<div class="section">
    Dear {!Recipient.Name},
</div>

<div class="section">
    This is a reminder that your AHIP / FFM certification is approaching expiration.
</div>

<table class="details-table">

    <tr>
        <th>Certification Name</th>
        <td>{!Certification__c.Name}</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <th>Certification Type</th>
        <td>{!Certification__c.Certification_Type__c}</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <th>Status</th>
        <td>{!Certification__c.Status__c}</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <th>Days Remaining</th>
        <td>
            <span class="warning">
                {!Certification__c.Days_Until_Expiry__c} Days
            </span>
        </td>
    </tr>

</table>

<div class="section">
    Please complete your renewal before the expiration date to avoid interruption in compliance or appointment eligibility.
</div>

<div class="section">
    If you have already renewed your certification, please disregard this message.
</div>

<div class="footer">
    Thank you,<br/>
    <strong>Compliance Team</strong>
</div>
```

</div>

</body>
</html>